# Text is LF in the repository AND in the working tree, on every platform.
# The evidence archive is assembled from working-tree files; six of them once
# sat on disk with CRLF while their commits held LF, so the archive could not
# be rebuilt from its own commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pth binary
*.rgba binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
